1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,800
India has so much to explore.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,800
But sometimes, exploring a new place
comes with a lot of questions.

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,900
Is this the right fare?

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,300
Can I trust this guide?

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,900
And what happens if something goes wrong?

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,600
What if you didn't have to
figure it all out yourself?

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,600
That's why we're building Sahvo.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,600
Know the fare. Know the guide.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,600
Starting in Jaipur, we're building a more
confident way to explore India.

10
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,400
This is Sahvo. And we're just getting started.
